  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>You can now restart your lab virtual machines by using the <strong>Restart</strong> button. You don&#39;t have to deallocate and reallocate a virtual machine every time you want to restart it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/52b3fbd5-26be-4090-a3ce-3c1ac5b0a39f.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"clip_image001\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/8615c8f2-9dec-415c-b663-b0a42c56bf12.png\" title=\"clip_image001\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "You can now restart your lab virtual machines by using the Restart button. You don't have to deallocate and reallocate a virtual machine every time you want to restart it."
  },
